"key":"say:4:1220238002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220238002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"约会怎么样呀？\\n不过看安格妮小姐的表情，应该很顺利吧？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1220238003:0":{"key":"say:5:1220238003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220238003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"嘿嘿，法迪夸我特别漂亮，还问我用了什么香水。都是多亏了...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1220238004:1":{"key":"say:6:1220238004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220238004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"什么香水？你身上一股鱼腥味啊，人类小姑娘。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1220238005:1":{"key":"say:7:1220238005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220238005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"喂，呼金，不可以对女孩子这样说话呀！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1220238006:1":{"key":"say:8:1220238006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220238006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"啊哈哈哈，没关系的，用锈锚港的水清洁就是会有顽固的鱼腥味……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1220238007:1":{"key":"say:9:1220238007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220238007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"即使您这次帮我用了清洁魔法，以后的约会还是要用我努力攒...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1220238008:1":{"key":"say:10:1220238008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220238008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"咦，下次约会，主人也可以帮您用清洁魔法的呀，安格妮小姐。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1220238009:0":{"key":"say:11:1220238009:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220238009","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"哈哈哈，太谢谢您了。\\n不过，也不能每次都麻烦魔法师大...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:12:1220238009":{"key":"choice_prompt:12:1220238009","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"122023